=== two notes on the readings above ===
1. The form-2 label lost its two backslashes: the shell inside the heredoc-free
   echo turned '' into a backspace byte. The pattern actually run was
   grep -nE '[0-9]{4,5}'.
2. README.md form2=3 is not a leftover runtime parameter. Those three are
   contract versions in the 'Local Agent Control Boundary' section
   (v1@2026.07.15.1 x2, v1@2026.07.14.7), i.e. identifiers that a reader has
   to see, not ports/addresses/credentials/timeouts. The comparison with the
   BEFORE reading is one for one: 5 form-2 hits then, 2 of them devUrl prose
   values (both now de-valued) + the same 3 contract versions.
   HEAD form-2 count over the three files: 5
   working-tree form-2 count over the three files: 3
